- Inner Join
- Description: Here, it shows only sales that have a matching customer and product
- Sql Code:
SELECT s.sales_id,
c.Fname,
p.product_name,
s.sales_date,
s.quantity,
s.total_amount
FROM Sales s
INNER JOIN Customer c ON s.customer_id = c.customer_id
INNER JOIN Products p ON s.product_id = p.product_id;
- Screenshot: ![inner join](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b3d1f0-3de9-4aa5-b10e-31876551c066)
 
- Left Join
- Description: Here, it shows customers who have never purchased a product
- Sql Code:
SELECT c.customer_id,
c.Fname,
s.sales_id
FROM Customer c
LEFT JOIN Sales s ON c.customer_id = s.customer_id
WHERE s.sales_id IS NULL;
- Screenshot: ![left join](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f523dee-886e-4e13-82cb-ab7f41d400ea)

- Right Join
- Description: It shows products that have never been sold
- Sql code:
SELECT p.product_id,
p.product_name,
s.sales_id
FROM Sales s
RIGHT JOIN Products p ON s.product_id = p.product_id
WHERE s.sales_id IS NULL
- Screenshot: ![right join](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6b4dfbb-b2e4-4f0e-9c14-60d4a1bb392b)

- Full outer Join
- Description: It shows all customers and all sales including those without sales
- Sql code:
SELECT c.customer_id,
c.Fname, c.Lname,
s.sales_id,
s.product_id
FROM Customer c
FULL OUTER JOIN Sales s
ON c.customer_id = s.customer_id;
- Screenshot: 
![full outer join](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/890b7346-9180-4e7c-b7cb-7e674175755a)

- Self Join
- Description: It pairs customers in the same region
- Sql code:
SELECT c1.Fname AS customer1,
c2.Fname AS customer2,
c1.region
FROM Customer c1
JOIN Customer c2
  ON c1.region = c2.region
 AND c1.customer_id < c2.customer_id;
- Screenshot: 
![self join](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2788616-a257-4db3-b626-1f996c094718)
